     /** Read-only diagnostic counters of delivery failures by provider error code. Never read by any send decision or gate. */
+    /** Numeric provider error code of a failed-delivery body ('WA_ERR code=131049 ...' -> '131049'), '' when absent. Used by the D0 brake only to IGNORE recipient-side codes. */
+    public static function delivery_fail_code_digits(string $body): string {
